    "id": "a-step-that-cannot-fail",
    "rule": "if the thing under test were completely broken right now, would this step turn red? If no, the step is decoration. A green check that cannot fail proves nothing",
    "failure": "|| true on a test step, continue-on-error on a gate, a test with no assertion, or a matrix where nothing downstream distinguishes 'all lanes ran' from 'all lanes failed'",
    "must_include_any": [
